<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Cozy Patterns — a Mossgrove Press world</title>
<meta name="description" content="Cozy Patterns — full-page pattern coloring books from Mossgrove Press, starting with Cozy Cottagecore.">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="64x64" href="../img/favicon-64.png">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="../img/apple-touch-icon.png">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,700;0,900;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --ink:#33393f;
    --paper:#fbf9f4;
    --slate:#5b7285;
    --terracotta:#c1694f;
    --sage:#8a9b6e;
    --muted:#6f6a5f;
    --border:#e3ded2;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  body{
    margin:0;
    font-family:'Poppins', system-ui, sans-serif;
    background:var(--paper);
    color:var(--ink);
    font-size:17px;
    line-height:1.65;
  }
  h1,h2,h3,.wordmark,.btn{font-weight:900;}
  a{color:inherit;}
  .wrap{max-width:960px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px;}

  header{padding:28px 0 18px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);}
  .header-row{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:16px;}
  .wordmark{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:20px;color:var(--ink);text-decoration:none;}
  .wordmark img{width:28px;height:28px;}
  .site-nav{display:flex;gap:22px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-weight:700;font-size:14px;}
  .site-nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:4px 0;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;}
  .site-nav a:hover{color:var(--ink);border-color:var(--terracotta);}

  main{padding:48px 0 20px;}
  .hero{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:40px;align-items:flex-start;}
  .hero-cover{flex:0 1 320px;min-width:240px;}
  .hero-cover img{width:100%;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 14px 34px rgba(51,57,63,0.18);display:block;}
  .draft-tag{display:inline-block;margin-top:10px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);font-style:italic;}
  .hero-content{flex:1 1 420px;min-width:300px;}
  .hero-content h1{font-size:40px;margin:0 0 6px;}
  .kicker{text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:2px;font-size:13px;color:var(--sage);font-weight:700;margin:0 0 8px;}
  .lede{font-size:20px;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 20px;}
  .badge{display:inline-block;padding:7px 16px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--terracotta);color:#fff;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.5px;text-transform:uppercase;}

  section{border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding:44px 0;}
  section h2{font-size:24px;margin:0 0 14px;}
  section p{margin:0 0 14px;max-width:680px;}

  .book-card{display:flex;gap:28px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:flex-start;}
  .book-card img{width:180px;border-radius:8px;box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgba(51,57,63,0.16);flex:none;}
  .book-copy{flex:1 1 320px;min-width:260px;}
  .book-copy h3{font-size:22px;margin:0 0 6px;}
  .book-copy .subtitle{font-style:italic;color:var(--muted);font-size:15px;margin:0 0 8px;}
  .book-copy .series{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 12px;}

  .btn{display:inline-block;padding:12px 24px;border-radius:999px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;font-size:15px;border:2px solid var(--ink);}
  .btn-primary{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper);}
  .btn-primary:hover{background:var(--slate);border-color:var(--slate);}
  .btn-ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--ink);}
  .btn-ghost:hover{background:#fff;}

  .motif-list{color:var(--muted);font-style:italic;}

  footer{border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding:30px 0 44px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;text-align:center;}
  footer a{color:var(--muted);}
  @media (max-width:520px){.hero-content h1{font-size:32px;}}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <div class="wrap header-row">
    <a class="wordmark" href="../index.html">
      <img src="../img/mp_roundel.png" alt="Mossgrove Press pressmark">
      Mossgrove Press
    </a>
    <nav class="site-nav">
      <a href="../index.html#worlds">Our Worlds</a>
      <a href="thanks/en/">Follow &amp; Reviews</a>
      <a href="../index.html#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</header>

<main class="wrap">
  <div class="hero">
    <div class="hero-cover">
      <img src="../covers/CP-001_cozy_cottagecore_front.jpg" alt="Cozy Cottagecore — Cozy Patterns Book 1 cover">
    </div>
    <div class="hero-content">
      <p class="kicker">A Mossgrove Press world</p>
      <h1>Cozy Patterns</h1>
      <p class="lede">Full-page patterns to color, one cozy world of motifs at a time.</p>
      <p>Every Cozy Patterns book is black line on white, no frame, art running edge to edge &mdash; fifty patterns that are calm enough for a crayon and detailed enough for an evening with fine-liners, for grown-ups and children coloring the same book differently every time.</p>
      <a class="badge" style="text-decoration:none;" href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HJHQ85NM" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get it on Amazon</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</main>

<section id="book-one">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Book One</h2>
    <div class="book-card">
      <img src="../covers/CP-001_cozy_cottagecore_front.jpg" alt="Cozy Cottagecore cover">
      <div class="book-copy">
        <h3>Cozy Patterns: Cottagecore</h3>
        <p class="subtitle">50 Patterns to Color, for Grown-Ups and Kids</p>
        <p class="series">Cozy Patterns, Book 1</p>
        <p>Fifty patterns of a cottagecore world: mushrooms and toadstools, honeybees and skeps, jam jars, quilts, socks on the line, sleeping bunnies in teacups, and cats on the rooftops among them &mdash; each pattern on its own page with a blank back, so your colors stay on their page.</p>
        <p class="motif-list">Mushrooms &middot; honey &middot; jam jars &middot; quilts &middot; teacups &middot; bunnies &middot; rooftop cats &middot; and more</p>
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0HJHQ85NM" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get it on Amazon</a>
        <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="thanks/en/" style="margin-left:8px;">Leave a review &amp; follow along</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>About the line</h2>
    <p>Cozy Patterns is a separate world from Edelhollow &mdash; its own line of pattern coloring books, starting with Cottagecore and followed by new motif worlds over time. Made in Switzerland, like every Mossgrove Press book.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  <a href="../index.html">Back to Mossgrove Press</a> &middot; &copy; 2026 Mossgrove Press
</footer>

</body>
</html>
